{"v":4,"catch":"環繞著星辰與羈絆展開的冒險，於Nintendo Switch™登場！\n星辰與遺跡降臨在我們的島上。","desc":"在世界的盡頭，少年遇見了少女。\n從以前起，就有人告訴我們……這個世界有「盡頭」。\n看似無邊無際的大海也有明確的終點，沒辦法越過去。\n「這是因為世界是平的」。許多學者都如此斷言，而人們也相信這樣的說法。……然而，真相真的如此嗎？\n不，我想一定不是這樣。世界上還有許多未知的事。「星辰碎片」裡映照出的「那種光景」，究竟是什麼？\n所以，我深深相信著，這個世界一定比想像中還要遼闊──","publisher":"Clouded Leopard Entertainment","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["動作","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 3.6GB / Switch 3.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8bb62b752daa6fd2a35e5edf00bad6e6e6e6922852e3bcdc0ed9f552d9340d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/81041e751bf2e30cc8e15ce1f99f96d274a98b9453dc7e1541ecb37707f3a9ff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e577ccbdfb39c4658326b9be3c05c3caedd59dc5935ae059a327a28da29f71aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/323653654700b1365195ddb3b373eea2bd2b27932402c88739fdab99a6895e9c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d3cee4774bbfea130e5646b88f0f617d1b89d3e651cbf74adf1bbd29989601b7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a6b3f62b296ba2eaba551086cc68ced41a821b6ec67f74271e7c655f353cd68.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e24017a6e000","dlc":[]}